function CardPaymentSimulator({cards,onResult}:{cards:T.Card[];onResult:(s:string)=>void}){const [id,setId]=useState(cards[0]?.id||""),[pay,setPay]=useState("1000"),[extra,setExtra]=useState("0"),[result,setResult]=useState<any>(null);const c=cards.find(x=>x.id===id)??cards[0];const run=()=>{const p=Math.min(c?.used||0,Number(pay)+Number(extra));const annual=(c?.tea||0)/100;const interest=(c?.used||0)*annual/12;const newBal=Math.max(0,(c?.used||0)-p);setResult({p,newBal,interestSaved:Math.min(interest,Number(extra))});onResult("Escenario calculado")};return <><div className="form2"><Field label="Tarjeta"><select value={id} onChange={e=>setId(e.target.value)}>{cards.map(c=><option key={c.id} value={c.id}>{c.bank} · •••• {c.last4}</option>)}</select></Field><Field label="Pago planeado"><input type="number" value={pay} onChange={e=>setPay(e.target.value)}/></Field><Field label="Pago adicional"><input type="number" value={extra} onChange={e=>setExtra(e.target.value)}/></Field></div><div className="notice"><b>¿Para qué sirve?</b><p>Compara cuánto baja la deuda si pagas una cantidad adicional. Es una simulación, no modifica la tarjeta hasta que registres el pago real.</p></div>{result&&<div className="needmoney">Pago total simulado <b>{money(result.p)}</b> · Nuevo saldo <b>{money(result.newBal)}</b> · Interés mensual estimado evitado <b>{money(result.interestSaved)}</b></div>}<Btn onClick={run}>Simular pago</Btn></>}

